The Egg Cagey Transition Matrix
Instead of asking, "Is there text now that wasn't there before?", Egg Cagey evaluates whether causal, non-reversible UI state transitions occurred across the submission boundary.
Sensor Tier	Transition Event	What It Proves	Can It Ghost?
🟢 Tier 1 (Direct Causal)
Composer: Populated → Empty
Send Button: Ready → Generating/Stop
Submission Left the Building.
The page state transitioned away from user input mode.
Extremely Low.
Requires the UI to clear its own input without user or button action.
🟡 Tier 2 (Active Generation)
Stream Target: Continuous Text Delta
Status Indicator: Thinking/Tool active
Model is Processing.
The engine is streaming new tokens or invoking backend tools.
Low.
Only if an existing previous response resumes late.
🔴 Tier 3 (Ambient Noise)
DOM Churn: Node mutations
Polling: Network tick events
Page is Active.
The browser tab is doing something.
High.
Triggers on ads, re-renders, telemetry, or UI animations.
How Egg Cagey Solves It Without Site-Specific DOM IDs
You don't need custom DOM selectors for every AI interface if you enforce a Two-Stage State Pulse Gate:
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│      SUBMIT ATTEMPT          │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
│
▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Stage 1: Submission Pulse (Tier 1)   │
│  • Did composer transition to empty? │
│  • Did send icon switch to stop?     │
└──────────────────┬───────────────────┘
│
YES ──────┴────── NO ───► [ Retry / Submission Failed ]
│
▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Stage 2: Generation Heartbeat (Tier 2)│
│  • Output array grew *AND*           │
│  • Streaming content actively shifts │
└──────────────────┬───────────────────┘
│
YES ──────┴────── NO ───► [ Timeout / Stall Detected ]
│
▼
[ SUCCESSFUL RELAY ]
Stage 1 (Submission Verification): Validates that the UI acknowledged the submission event via Tier 1 state transitions.
Stage 2 (Generation Verification): Confirms that the backend is actively generating content via Tier 2 streaming deltas.
By separating Submission Proof from Generation Heartbeat, Egg Cagey eliminates false positives caused by static snapshot comparisons.

